  "body": "## What changed\n\nTwo test literals of `Tilt` get `basis_version: 1`:\n- `crates/app/src/posting_section_mode.rs:133` (unit test `classifies_3axis_3plus2_and_simultaneous_distinctly`);\n- `crates/app/tests/section_mode.rs:128`.\n\n## Why\n\nPR #2157 added the required field `Tilt::basis_version`. PR #2245 added these tests with the old `Tilt` shape. Each PR built alone; merged one after the other, the test build of `camcraft-app` fails with E0063, so main is red. `basis_version: 1` is the value of every other new `Tilt` literal (`operation/frame.rs`, `tests/area_controls.rs`). Test code only; no product code or G-code changes.\n\n## Readings (on dude, branch head)\n\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-geometry -p camcraft-cl -p camcraft-tools -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: green (red on main `2b7a8950d`).\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test section_mode`: 2 passed.\n- `cargo test -p xtask`: green.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #2270\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX\n",
